"でも、やっぱり嬉しかった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花ありがとうございました🌸🌷︎🌻💮"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_5.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また皆さんとお会い出来る日が楽しみです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーMCを務めたなおちゃんでしめます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_7.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(乃木坂46さん新四期 弓木奈於)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のお姉ちゃん的存在なおちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じがしますよね。でもちがうんです。\nなおちゃんはどちらかと言うと私に甘えてました。\n意外!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一言一言がおもしろい。耳が離せない存在です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC本当にお疲れ様!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん本当にありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⭐新二期生紹介⭐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お次は幸阪茉里乃(こうさかまりの)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※幸阪の阪は阪です、坂×"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでたっても「さんごちゃん」というあだ名で呼んでしまいます。まりのっぺ。まりのん。うーん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_8.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく、手を繋ぎながら歩いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく、お互いの肩に顔をスリスリしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく、顔を見合せながら「ちゅきだもんね〜」と、猫なで声で言い合っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"増本そこ代われって思ってる人〜🙋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでは惚気です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紹介します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_9.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茉里乃さんは、小さくて、チョコチョコ動きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目が大きくてうるうるしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話してみると低めの抑揚のない声で淡々としてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘えん坊さん、ツンツン、小動物、弱そう、まだまだ見れていない面がたくさんある子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱり小さくてかわいい。守りたい。\nけど私には守りきれそうにない、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで皆さん、ぜひ茉里乃ちゃんを守ってあげてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何から??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もうちの可愛い黒猫ちゃん載せよう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_10.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫ってお味噌汁のにおいしますよね?\nだから好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の作品もそうなのですが、うちの猫は私が写真を撮ろうとすると逃げるので、だいたい姉に撮ってもらっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/files/14/diary/k46o/member/masumoto_200428_11.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん気になりましたよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜこんなに青いのか。\n私も気になってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真相は姉しか知らない。\n聞くほど気にはなりませんが、まぁ、冷気かフィルターでしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーヒーを作るための粉がチョコに似ていたからそのまま食べたらすんごく苦かったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味の密度がすごい"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-s46-59145":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小田倉麗奈(おだくられいな)です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねこの日だったということで特別に……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"^._.^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202502/mobFYomFV.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202502/mobrOu2P6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミミ付けてみちゃった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/22(土)、2/23(日)のミーグリ、\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半年ぶりだから緊張しちゃうかも、と思っていたのですが、楽しくてあっという間に時間が過ぎていきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会いできて本当に嬉しかったです！\nいつもありがとうございます¨̮⃝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次にみなさんとお会いできるのは3/2のリアルミーグリですね\n今からワクワクするよ〜 "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty